<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"
    xmlns:ev="http://www.w3.org/2001/xml-events"
    xmlns:w2="http://www.inswave.com/websquare" xmlns:xf="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms">
    <head>
    	<w2:type>DEFAULT</w2:type>
        <w2:buildDate/>
        <xf:model>
            <xf:instance>
                <data xmlns=""/>
            </xf:instance>
            <w2:dataCollection baseNode="map">
            	<w2:dataList id="dataList1" baseNode="list" saveRemovedData="true" repeatNode="map">
            		<w2:columnInfo>
            			<w2:column id="col1" name="name1" dataType="text"></w2:column>
            			<w2:column id="col2" name="name2" dataType="text"></w2:column>
            			<w2:column id="col3" name="name3" dataType="text"></w2:column>
            		</w2:columnInfo>
            	</w2:dataList>
            </w2:dataCollection>
            <w2:workflowCollection>
            </w2:workflowCollection>
        </xf:model>
        <script type="text/javascript"><![CDATA[

scwin.onpageload = function () {

};

scwin.onpageunload = function () {

};
var count = 0;

scwin.trigger1_onclick = function (e) {
    count++;
    widgetContainer1.addWidgets({
        id: "true_" + count,
        title: "true_" + count,
        //src : "widget.xml",
        scope: true,
        x: 0,
        y: 0,
        unitWidth: 2,
        unitHeight: 1
    });

    widgetContainer2.addWidgets({
        id: "false_" + count,
        title: "false_" + count,
        //src : "widget.xml",
        scope: true,
        x: 0,
        y: 0,
        unitWidth: 2,
        unitHeight: 1
    });
};

]]></script>
    </head>
    <body style="padding:20px;">
    	<xf:group id="" style="">
    		<w2:textbox tagname="h1" style="color: blue;margin-bottom: 10px;" tabIndex="h1" id="textbox1" label="위젯 타이틀 더블 클릭을 통한 위젯 최대화 방지"
    			escape="false">
    		</w2:textbox>
    		<w2:textbox tagname="h2" style="height: 23px;margin-bottom: 10px;color: blue;" id="textbox2" label="샘플 사용 방법"></w2:textbox>
    		<w2:textbox style="color: blue;margin-bottom: 30px;" id="textbox3"
    			label='1. 하단의 addWidgets() 버튼을 클릭.&lt;br/&gt;2. 위젯이 생성되는 것을 확인. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;(첫 번째 Widget Container)&lt;br/&gt;3-1. 추가된 위젯의 타이틀 부분을 더블 클릭. &lt;br/&gt;3-2. 위젯이 최대화되지 않는 것을 확인. (preventMaximizeByTitle="true")&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;(두 번째 WidgetContainer) &lt;br/&gt;4-1. 추가된 위젯의 타이틀 부분을 더블 클릭. &lt;br/&gt;4-2. 위젯이 최대화되는 것을 확인. (preventMaximizeByTitle="false")&lt;br/&gt;4-3. 위젯의 타이틀 부분을 다시 더블 클릭. &lt;br/&gt;4-4. 원래의 위젯 크기로 복귀하는 것을 확인.'
    			escape="false">
    		</w2:textbox>
    		<xf:trigger ev:onclick="scwin.trigger1_onclick"
    			style="height:42px;line-height:32px;padding:5px;background-color:coral;font-size:15px;weight: bolder;font-weight:bolder;text-align: left;display: block;margin-bottom: 10px;"
    			id="trigger1" type="button">
    			<xf:label><![CDATA[addWidgets()]]></xf:label>
    		</xf:trigger>
    		<w2:textbox
    			style="padding:5px;text-align:left;font-size: 15px;font-weight:bolder;background-color: lightblue;border:none;margin-bottom: 10px;"
    			id="textbox4" label='속성 설정&lt;br/&gt;preventMaximizeByTitle="true"' escape="false">
    		</w2:textbox>
    		<w2:widgetContainer mode="pushpull" unitHeightPixel="200" widgetMove="true"
    			style="height: 200px;border:1px solid black;margin-bottom: 10px;" id="widgetContainer1" cols="3"
    			ev:onwidgetmove="scwin.widgetContainer1_onwidgetmove" preventMaximizeByTitle="true">
    		</w2:widgetContainer>
    		<w2:textbox escape="false" id="textbox5" label='속성 설정&lt;br/&gt;preventMaximizeByTitle="false"'
    			style="padding:5px;text-align:left;font-size: 15px;font-weight:bolder;background-color: lightblue;border:none;margin-bottom: 10px;">
    		</w2:textbox>
    		<w2:widgetContainer cols="3" ev:onwidgetmove="scwin.widgetContainer1_onwidgetmove" id="widgetContainer2" mode="pushpull"
    			style="height: 200px;border:1px solid black;margin-bottom: 10px;" unitHeightPixel="200"
    			widgetMove="true">
    		</w2:widgetContainer>
    	</xf:group>
    </body>
</html>
